SUMMARY:🎂🥩 MATHEW’S BIRTHDAY DINNER AT THE KEG MANSION 🥩🎂
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n🎂
 🥩 MATHEW’S BIRTHDAY DINNER AT THE KEG MANSION 🥩🎂\nAn Intimate E
 vening\, Great Food & One of Toronto’s Most Haunted Mansions 👀\n\nThi
 s year\, we’re celebrating in one of the most iconic and atmospheric res
 taurants in the city.\n\nJoin me for my birthday dinner at The Keg Mansion
  — a historic mansion filled with elegance\, history… and more than a 
 few ghost stories.\n\nOriginally built in 1867\, the mansion was once the 
 home of Hart Massey and one of Toronto’s wealthiest families before even
 tually becoming the restaurant we know today. Over the years\, it’s also
  become famous for its haunted reputation\, mysterious sightings\, and eer
 ie atmosphere.\n\nExpect:\n🥩 Incredible food\n🕯️ A stunning histor
 ic mansion\n👻 A slightly spooky vibe\n🍷 A warm\, intimate evening to
 gether\n\nClick Here - [Menu](https://thekeg.com/en/locations/mansion/menu
 )\n\nThis is one of those places that feels like a full experience — not
  just dinner.\n\n🏛️ Please note: This is a historic building — no e
 levator and lots of stairs. Just something to be aware of before you come.
 \n\n📲 **Join Our WhatsApp Group:**[ Click here to join](https://chat.wh
 atsapp.com/DRFTkxRlHS4B3IL1lMleUd)\n\n***\n\n🍝 The Plan\n\nWe’ll gath
 er\, settle in\, and enjoy a relaxed evening of food\, conversation\, and 
 connection.\nThis is a smaller\, more intimate event — capped at **25 pe
 ople** to keep the experience comfortable and social.\nWhether you’ve be
 en to many events or this is your first — you’re absolutely welcome.\n
 \n“A stranger is just a friend you haven’t met yet.”\n\n***\n\n🎁 
 Birthday Note (Please Read)\n\nYour presence is more than enough.\n\n🎂 
 No gifts are needed\n🎁 No group gifts\n\n***Please do not organize or c
 ontribute to any group gift — no one should feel any pressure around tha
 t.***\n\nThis night is about spending time together. That’s it.\n\n***\n
 \n🧢 Meetup Details\n📍 Location: The Keg Mansion\n🫎I will be outsi
 de and I will be wearing my Moose hat.\n⏰ Meetup Time: 5:15PM\nI will on
 ly wait 5 minutes.\n(And yes… don’t keep the birthday boy waiting 😉
 )\n\n***\n\n💳 **Reservation & Commitment**\n\nTo secure your spot:\n\nI
 f you’ve *never attended* an event with Mathew before\, a **$30 seat dep
 osit** is required via e-transfer to\n\n📧 **mathewmaclean@hotmail.com**
  within 24 hours of signing up.\n✔️ You will receive the $30 back when
  you arrive\n❗ No refunds or exchanges if you cancel\n\nThis helps ensur
 e committed attendance\, as reservations are being made in advance.\n\n***
 \n\n💵 Cost\n\nThere is **no meetup fee** for this event — this is my 
 way of saying thank you for being part of this community 💖\nMeals are i
 ndividual (expect $$–$$$ depending on what you order).\n\n***\n\n⚠️ 
 Important\n\nPlease do NOT contact the restaurant about this event — the
 y won’t have details.\nFor any questions\, message me directly.\n\n***\n
 \n🌈 Who Is This For?\n\nThis group is open to anyone who wants to be so
 cial and make friends — whether single or not.\n\nWe also host:\n\n🎬 
 Movies\n🚶 Walks & hikes\n🎭 Arts & culture outings\n🍽️ Restauran
 t gatherings\nThere’s always something happening.\n\n***\n\n👤 Organiz
 er: Mathew\nQuestions? Post on the event wall or email\n📧 torontomovies
 andoutings@hotmail.com\n\nCome for the pasta. Stay for the people.\nLeave 
 feeling like you were part of something special. 🎂✨
